					"nextDialogs": [
						760850603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 760850603,
					"content": "是我目前為止最喜歡的一杯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760850604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 760850604,
					"content": "哇！總算讓我們試出哥倫比婭喜歡的口味了，我好感動…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760850605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760850605,
					"content": "唔…對不起？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760850606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 760850606,
					"content": "總結一下，就是不要有明顯的苦味，不要直接用果汁，好像不加牛奶比加牛奶更好…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760850607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760850607,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760850608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 760850608,
					"content": "這就是「不厚重」的配方…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760850609
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760850609,
					"content": "能夠總結出規律也是好事，以後就知道要怎麼調製了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760850610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760850610,
					"content": "…以後？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760850611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 760850611,
					"content": "當然，我們是朋友嘛！妳想喝的時候，再跟我們說就好啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760850612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760850612,
					"content": "妳該不會是覺得喝了這杯就再也沒有了，才一直沒捨得喝完吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760850613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760850613,
					"content": "唔…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760850614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 760850614,
					"content": "放心吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760850615
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760850615,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760850616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
